<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Australia 2001 T-bond yld averages 7.440 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Australia 2001 T-bond yld averages 7.440 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of today's A$700 million T-bond tender, announced by Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA):</p>
<p>  Stock	  Offering	   Allotted	  Avg yield   Range</p>
<p>  8.75 Jan 01  AS400 million    A$400 million     7.440     7.44 only</p>
<p>		   (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 100)</p>
<p>  Stock	  Offering	   Allotted	  Avg yield   Range</p>
<p>  8.75 Aug 08  AS300 million    A$300 million     8.040     8.04 only</p>
<p>		   (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 100)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
